SUMMARY:13th Congress of the European Academy of Neurology
DESCRIPTION:The European Academy of Neurology holds its 2027 congress at 
 Gothia Towers in Gothenburg\, Sweden\, from 12 to 15 June 2027. The cong
 ress theme is Transforming Neurology\, Embracing Every Brain\, and the p
 rogram spans general and subspecialty neurology.\n\nDeadlines\nAbstract 
 submission: 2027-01-14\nEarly registration: 2027-04-14\n\nhttps://www.ea
 n.org/congress2027
